[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/Enemies/BossAddWaveResource.cs" id="3_wave"]
[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/Combat/Actions/ActionDefinitionResource.cs" id="4_action"]

; The Crimson Prophet's fight, modelled on data/bosses/IronKing.tres: three phases, add waves, and a
; third phase that fights differently rather than faster.
;
;   phase 1  the sermon. He holds the middle of the sanctum at range (ai.prophet) and throws firebolts
;            and wither; the answer is to close the distance.
;   phase 2  the congregation. At two thirds his worshippers answer the call — cultists, repeating and
;            capped at three alive — and he adds the flame lance.
;   phase 3  the voice of Morthul. At a third he stops preaching: ai.boss, fireball, and two committed,
;            uninterruptible blows. The zealots keep coming, cinder thralls join them once.
;
; No enrage, for the Iron King's reason: a Flamebearer is beaten at the player's pace.

